    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project UD</strong> is a multiplayer action game that combines asymmetric escape survival with high-quality pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city haunted by strange phenomena, you must play as explorers with various abilities to fight against monsters, complete quests, find loot, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/a787b1694c13dfdb02a030bfac0cdf3c.poster.avif?t=1740361965\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/a787b1694c13dfdb02a030bfac0cdf3c.webm?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/a787b1694c13dfdb02a030bfac0cdf3c.mp4?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 2 players and explore the city full of threats.\u00a0 Of course, it is also possible to venture alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must respond to various situations by combining various characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful and special consumable items to overcome the crisis.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e412df1eb7114818013521aeb79896d2.poster.avif?t=1740361965\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e412df1eb7114818013521aeb79896d2.webm?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e412df1eb7114818013521aeb79896d2.mp4?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your hands on magical and super-scientific weapons that can help you fight against monsters in the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve the valuables you were asked to search for from the abnormal space and escape safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various maps engulfed in strange anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e96c99cd5aec1a038c94fce991d29e9e.poster.avif?t=1740361965\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e96c99cd5aec1a038c94fce991d29e9e.webm?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e96c99cd5aec1a038c94fce991d29e9e.mp4?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various dangers such as otherworldly monsters, grotesque phenomena, and runaway mecha.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the various devices remaining in the evacuated city to help you survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain an arcane seal to get strengthening effects to respond to rapidly changing situations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/8809575ddd4258536cc238188a27c790.avif?t=1740361965\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop various characters with unique occupations such as Front, Shooter, Mystic, and Supporter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up various equipment to maximize your character\u2019s abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your character\u2019s skill tree according to your desired characteristics\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e2600a2ee78380c8537bfa276f3ba24a.poster.avif?t=1740361965\" width=576 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e2600a2ee78380c8537bfa276f3ba24a.webm?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run an antique cafe that attracts special customers in a city where strange phenomena have become a daily routine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist investigators exploring abnormal spaces and help them escape safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broker requests from customers looking for items that can only be found in the abnormal space and acquire benefits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Project UD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project UD\u00a0</strong>is being developed by a small team that loves a variety of Co-op multiplayer games, dungeon crawlers, and loot shooters. If you enjoyed <strong>Project Zomboid, Risk of Rain, the Diablo series, Strange Dungeon series</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Darkest Dungeon series</strong>, Project UD will give you the pleasure of a unique new combination of the dungeon crawler genre in the cosmic horror urban fantasy world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project UD</strong> is a multiplayer action game that combines asymmetric escape survival with high-quality pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city haunted by strange phenomena, you must play as explorers with various abilities to fight against monsters, complete quests, find loot, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/a787b1694c13dfdb02a030bfac0cdf3c.poster.avif?t=1740361965\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/a787b1694c13dfdb02a030bfac0cdf3c.webm?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/a787b1694c13dfdb02a030bfac0cdf3c.mp4?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 2 players and explore the city full of threats.\u00a0 Of course, it is also possible to venture alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must respond to various situations by combining various characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful and special consumable items to overcome the crisis.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e412df1eb7114818013521aeb79896d2.poster.avif?t=1740361965\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e412df1eb7114818013521aeb79896d2.webm?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e412df1eb7114818013521aeb79896d2.mp4?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your hands on magical and super-scientific weapons that can help you fight against monsters in the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve the valuables you were asked to search for from the abnormal space and escape safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various maps engulfed in strange anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e96c99cd5aec1a038c94fce991d29e9e.poster.avif?t=1740361965\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e96c99cd5aec1a038c94fce991d29e9e.webm?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e96c99cd5aec1a038c94fce991d29e9e.mp4?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various dangers such as otherworldly monsters, grotesque phenomena, and runaway mecha.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the various devices remaining in the evacuated city to help you survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain an arcane seal to get strengthening effects to respond to rapidly changing situations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/8809575ddd4258536cc238188a27c790.avif?t=1740361965\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop various characters with unique occupations such as Front, Shooter, Mystic, and Supporter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up various equipment to maximize your character\u2019s abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your character\u2019s skill tree according to your desired characteristics\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e2600a2ee78380c8537bfa276f3ba24a.poster.avif?t=1740361965\" width=576 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/extras/e2600a2ee78380c8537bfa276f3ba24a.webm?t=1740361965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run an antique cafe that attracts special customers in a city where strange phenomena have become a daily routine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist investigators exploring abnormal spaces and help them escape safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broker requests from customers looking for items that can only be found in the abnormal space and acquire benefits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Project UD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project UD\u00a0</strong>is being developed by a small team that loves a variety of Co-op multiplayer games, dungeon crawlers, and loot shooters. If you enjoyed <strong>Project Zomboid, Risk of Rain, the Diablo series, Strange Dungeon series</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Darkest Dungeon series</strong>, Project UD will give you the pleasure of a unique new combination of the dungeon crawler genre in the cosmic horror urban fantasy world.</p>",
    "short_description": "Project UD combines extraction games and pixel art to create a new action experience. Explore a city surrounded by abnormal phenomena, overcome monsters and traps, complete missions, and acquire loot. If you work together with friends, you can deal with many more threats.",
